{"4304980":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Drilling","steam_appid":4304980,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become Drilly, an ancient creature from the Moon who woke up deep underground, and set out on a journey back home. This mining adventure skips flashy combat and fierce competition and focuses on the simple joy of digging forward. Mine nine grades of rare ore scattered across each region, then spend what you collect on upgrades for your drill: size, power, movement speed and more.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No need to overthink it. Just dig and upgrade.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MINE ORE<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carve your own path through the earth. The higher you climb, the more precious the ore. Spend it on upgrades, meet the folks who live underground, and interact with the world around you. You might even unlock something special.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4304980\/extras\/9c4604fb167ad8e94623ae1a661a1399.poster.avif?t=1793729004\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4304980\/extras\/9c4604fb167ad8e94623ae1a661a1399.webm?t=1793729004\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4304980\/extras\/9c4604fb167ad8e94623ae1a661a1399.mp4?t=1793729004\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADE<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your drill, your jetpack and more. Every ability exists for one purpose: digging. Keep exploring and you will unlock new ones. Upgrade, then enjoy the dig.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4304980\/extras\/9e50106a6d66038ce8b71b6acec28b15.poster.avif?t=1793729004\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4304980\/extras\/9e50106a6d66038ce8b71b6acec28b15.webm?t=1793729004\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4304980\/extras\/9e50106a6d66038ce8b71b6acec28b15.mp4?t=1793729004\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REACH FOR THE MOON<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drilly lived a peaceful life on the Moon until a trip to Earth went wrong and left it buried deep underground. Waking from a long sleep, Drilly has one goal: to return home to the Moon. Break through layer after layer of earth, climb to the surface, and help Drilly reach the Moon in the sky above.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4304980\/extras\/b50629ccf58cbcc164fad621f398bfa5.poster.avif?t=1793729004\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4304980\/extras\/b50629ccf58cbcc164fad621f398bfa5.webm?t=1793729004\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4304980\/extras\/b50629ccf58cbcc164fad621f398bfa5.mp4?t=1793729004\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become Drilly, an ancient creature from the Moon who woke up deep underground, and set out on a journey back home. This mining adventure skips flashy combat and fierce competition and focuses on the simple joy of digging forward. Mine nine grades of rare ore scattered across each region, then spend what you collect on upgrades for your drill: size, power, movement speed and more.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No need to overthink it. Just dig and upgrade.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MINE ORE<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carve your own path through the earth. The higher you climb, the more precious the ore. Spend it on upgrades, meet the folks who live underground, and interact with the world around you. You might even unlock something special.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4304980\/extras\/9c4604fb167ad8e94623ae1a661a1399.poster.avif?t=1793729004\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4304980\/extras\/9c4604fb167ad8e94623ae1a661a1399.webm?t=1793729004\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4304980\/extras\/9c4604fb167ad8e94623ae1a661a1399.mp4?t=1793729004\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADE<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your drill, your jetpack and more. Every ability exists for one purpose: digging. Keep exploring and you will unlock new ones. Upgrade, then enjoy the dig.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4304980\/extras\/9e50106a6d66038ce8b71b6acec28b15.poster.avif?t=1793729004\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4304980\/extras\/9e50106a6d66038ce8b71b6acec28b15.webm?t=1793729004\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4304980\/extras\/9e50106a6d66038ce8b71b6acec28b15.mp4?t=1793729004\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REACH FOR THE MOON<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drilly lived a peaceful life on the Moon until a trip to Earth went wrong and left it buried deep underground. Waking from a long sleep, Drilly has one goal: to return home to the Moon. Break through layer after layer of earth, climb to the surface, and help Drilly reach the Moon in the sky above.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4304980\/extras\/b50629ccf58cbcc164fad621f398bfa5.poster.avif?t=1793729004\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4304980\/extras\/b50629ccf58cbcc164fad621f398bfa5.webm?t=1793729004\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4304980\/extras\/b50629ccf58cbcc164fad621f398bfa5.mp4?t=1793729004\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"&quot;DRILLING&quot; is a relaxing game focusing on the pure joy of digging and moving forward. You play as &quot;Mr. Drill,&quot; who has awakened deep underground, and begin an expedition toward the surface. Mine 9 kind of ores found across various layers, and use the resources you gather to upgrade your modules.","supported_languages":"English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Spanish - Spain, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4304980\/af44edb4b8952ee38c1f757f6a6f072806cadd62\/header.jpg?t=1793729004","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_asset